<section background-color="heading">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="35" vertical-align="center">
      <p role="eyebrow">Visual communication · Media evolution</p>
      <h1 font-size="44pt">The page changed its behavior</h1>
      <p font-size="lg">The page did not disappear. It changed from fixed arrangement, to interactive surface, to variable output.</p>
      <spacer mode="fixed" size="24pt"/>
      <hr horizontalAlign="left" width="xs" thickness="md" color="accent"/>
      <p><b>Thesis:</b> media evolution reorganizes production, distribution, interaction, and authorship. It does not guarantee improvement.</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="25" padding="0">
      <grid direction="vertical" spacing="none">
        <grid-item rowspan="52" padding="0">
          <ai-image background="true" aspect-ratio="portrait" image-style="editorial-media-study" prompt="Large-format editorial studio photograph of one page-like media mechanism evolving across three aligned stages: a rigid archive-buff paper frame, a linked screen-grey window, and several variable sheets emerging along vermilion plotter paths, arranged as a precise material study under cool raking daylight on warm paper, carbon black structural elements, generous negative space, no text or lettering"/>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item rowspan="8" background-color="surface" padding="10pt 14pt">
          <p role="caption">Conceptual media study · not archival evidence</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>